  "prefLabel": "Env-A 4802.03 Multi-State Auctions",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 4802.03 Multi-State Auctions. The department shall participate in a multi-state CO2 allowance auction if the department determines that:\n\n(a) Multi-state auction capabilities and processes are in place for the participating states;\n\n(b) A multi-state auction can provide benefits that meet or exceed the objectives of the auction and purposes of the NHAA, as described in this part; and\n\n(c) The multi-state auction process would be consistent with the process described in this part.\n\nSource. #9284, INTERIM, eff 10-1-08, EXPIRE: 3-30-09\n\nNew. #9445, eff 4-3-09; ss by #10470, eff 1-1-14; ss by #13974, eff 5-23-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-a4800.html"
